\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3.1}{\ignorespaces Overview of the proposed training and evaluation pipeline. A DIFUSCO-style diffusion model is first trained by supervised denoising on solver-generated binary labels \citep {sun2023difusco}. The trained checkpoint can then be fine-tuned with a CADO-style reinforcement learning objective based on decoded solution quality \citep {yoon2024cado}. }}{16}{figure.caption.9}%
