\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {4.1}{\ignorespaces Improvement after CADO-style RL fine-tuning \citep {yoon2024cado}. TSP and CVRP report reductions in optimality gap, while MDVRP reports the assignment-accuracy gain from the first CADO validation point to the best CADO checkpoint.}}{28}{figure.caption.11}%
